ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh093: OPEN_SHELL with 2 ADVANCED_FACEs each wired with zero-length EDGE_CURVEs; each EDGE_CURVE has same VERTEX_POINT for start and end — IS the degenerate-edge mechanism; LINE direction vector magnitude 0.0 IS directly in the edge topology; all faces carry zero-length-edge defect — all rejected by ShapeFix_Shell.Perform; all-faces-rejected outcome IS the mechanism exposing silent empty-shell return; ShapeFix_Shell.Perform returns empty shell with no diagnostic flag set; fix: set error flag / raise when output shell is empty after Perform; emit E_SHELL_PERFORM_EMPTY_OUTPUT when all faces are rejected */
